    "preamble": "Mohammed Ikbal S/O Ali Mohammad vs State Of Rajasthan (2024:Rj-Jp:48000) on 25 November, 2024 Author: Mahendar Kumar Goyal Bench: Mahendar Kumar Goyal [2024:Rj-Jp:48000] High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Civil Writ Petition No. 16708/2024 1. Mohammed Ikbal S/o Ali Mohammad, Aged About 52 Years, R/o Ward No. 08, Mukundgarh Mandi, Mukundgarh (Rural), District- Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan. 2. Mohammad Ajiz S/o Abdul Haq, Aged About 60 Years, R/o Ward No. 08, Mukundgarh Mandi, Mukundgarh (Rural), District- Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan . 3. Japhar S/o Ali Mohammad, Aged About 46 Years, R/o Ward No. 07, Mukundgarh (Rural), District Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan . ----Petitioners Versus 1. State Of Rajasthan, Through The Secretary, Department Of Food And Civil Supplies, Government Of Rajasthan, At Secretariat, Jaipur. 2. Office Of The District Food Safety And Drugs Controller- Jhunjhunu, Through The Designated Officer (Food Safety) And Chief Medical And Health Officer- Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan. 3. Municipal Board- Mukundgarh, Through The Executive Officer, District- Jhunjhunu. 4. Anwar, M/s Khatri Meat Shop, At Ward No. 08, Mukangarhmandi, Mukangarh (Rural), District Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan. 5. Khalid Khatri S/o Gulam Husain, R/o M/s Khatri Meat Corner, Ward No. 08, Mukundgarh Mandi, District- Jhunjhunu (Rajasthan). 6. Mohd. Irfan Khatri S/o Mohd Yasin Khan, R/o M/s Khatri Meat Shop At Ward No. 08, Mukundgarh Mandi, District- Jhunjhunu (Rajasthan) 7. Mo. Aslam S/o Gulam Husain, R/o M/s Khatri Meat Shop At Ward No. 08, Mukundgarh Mandi, District- Jhunjhunu (Rajasthan). ----Respondents For Petitioner(s) : Mr. David Mehla with Mr. Dharmendra Singh For Respondent(s) : Mohammed Ikbal S/O Ali Mohammad vs State Of Rajasthan (2024:Rj-Jp:48000) on 25 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40079847/ 1 HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE MAHENDAR KUMAR GOYAL Judgment / Order 25/11/2024 [2024:RJ-JP:48000] (2 of 2) [CW-16708/2024 ] Learned counsel for the petitioners wants to withdraw this civil writ petition as he has instructions to avail the appropriate remedy available under the law for redressal of their grievance(s).",
